<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Community Waste Management System</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <a class="logo" href="#home"><i aria-hidden="true">♻</i><span>Community Waste Management System</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#features">Features</a><a
                href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
        <div class="auth-buttons">
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-auth-open="login">
        Log in
    </button>

    <button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-auth-open="signup">
        Register
    </button>
</div>

<div id="who" hidden></div>
    </header>


    <main id="home">
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="txt">
                <h1>Community <b>Waste Management</b> System</h1>
                <p>Together for a Cleaner, Greener Community</p>
                <button class="btn" data-open="pickup">Get Started<span class="arrow"> →</span></button>
            </div>
            <div class="stage">
                <div class="tips">
                    <button class="card" data-open="categories"><span class="ic">👥</span><span><strong>Waste
                                Categories</strong><small>Proper segregation for a cleaner
                                community.</small></span></button>
                    <button class="card" data-open="schedule"><span class="ic">📅</span><span><strong>Pickup
                                Scheduling</strong><small>Request a collection in just a few
                                clicks.</small></span></button>
                    <button class="card" data-open="programs"><span class="ic">🍃</span><span><strong>Community
                                Programs</strong><small>Join initiatives and make an impact.</small></span></button>
                </div>
                <div class="bins"><img
                        src="data:image/webp;base64,"
                        alt="Green, blue and yellow recycling bins">
                    <button class="bin h1" aria-label="Green bin"
                        data-bin="Green bin: biodegradable waste such as food scraps, leaves and garden trimmings."></button>
                    <button class="bin h2" aria-label="Blue bin"
                        data-bin="Blue bin: recyclables such as clean paper, cardboard, plastic bottles and cans."></button>
                    <button class="bin h3" aria-label="Yellow bin"
                        data-bin="Yellow bin: special waste such as batteries, bulbs and electronics. Request a pickup for these."></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="leaf" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="feat" id="features">
            <div class="wrap">
                <button class="card" data-open="schedule"><span class="ic">📅</span><strong>Schedule
                        Collection</strong><small>View and manage waste collection schedules in your
                        area.</small></button>
                <button class="card" data-open="pickup"><span class="ic">🚚</span><strong>Request
                        Pickup</strong><small>Book a pickup for bulky or special waste items.</small></button>
                <button class="card" data-open="guide"><span class="ic">📖</span><strong>Recycling
                        Guide</strong><small>Learn how to properly separate and dispose of waste.</small></button>
                <button class="card" data-open="programs"><span class="ic">👥</span><strong>Community
                        Participation</strong><small>Join programs, earn rewards, and help make an
                        impact.</small></button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="s" id="about">
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>The Community Waste Management System helps neighbors sort waste correctly, schedule collections, and
                take part in local clean-up programs, so your barangay stays clean and green.</p>
            
    <section class="pg" id="contact"></section>

             <h2>Contact</h2>
             <p>Questions or concerns about collection in your area? Send us a message.</p>
 <form class="ct" id="contactForm">
       <input required placeholder="Your name" aria-label="Your name">
       <input required type="email" placeholder="Email" aria-label="Email">
       <textarea required rows="4" placeholder="Message" aria-label="Message"></textarea>
       <button class="btn" type="submit" style="justify-self:start">Send message</button>
       <div class="ok" id="sent" hidden>Thanks! Your message was sent.</div>
 </form>
</section>
        </section>

    </main>
    

   <dialog id="dlg">
    <h2 id="dt"></h2>
    <div id="db"></div>
</dialog>

<script src="script.js"></script>



</body>
</html>
    